---
---
<section class="bg-[#A9CF38] pt-10 pb-20 px-5 relative z-10 lg:pt-16 lg:pb-28 lg:px-16">

  <div class="lg:grid lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-16 lg:items-center lg:max-w-6xl lg:mx-auto">

    <!-- Columna izquierda: texto -->
    <div>
      <!-- Badge -->
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 lg:gap-2 bg-white/70 rounded-full px-4 lg:px-4 py-2 lg:py-2 text-sm lg:text-sm font-display text-gray-800 mb-5 lg:mb-5">
        <span>Cada historia empieza con una mamá que se atrevió.</span>
        <span>✨</span>
      </div>

      <!-- Heading -->
      <h1 class="font-bold text-5xl text-black mb-5 lg:mb-5 font-sans leading-tight lg:text-6xl">
        Cuéntanos<br>
        tu <span class="bg-[#E75F24] text-white px-4 lg:px-4 py-1 lg:py-1 rounded-xl inline-block">historia</span>
      </h1>

      <!-- Párrafo -->
      <p class="text-base font-display text-gray-900 mb-7 lg:mb-7 leading-relaxed lg:max-w-md lg:text-lg">
        Este micrófono es tuyo. <strong>Buscamos mamás emprendedoras</strong> que quieran compartir su camino sin guion, sin filtro y sin pretender que todo fue fácil. Lo real inspira. Lo perfecto aburre.
      </p>

      <!-- CTA -->
      <a
        href="#"
        class="inline-block bg-white text-black font-bold py-3 px-8 rounded-full font-display text-sm border-2 border-black hover:bg-gray-100 transition-colors lg:py-4 lg:px-12 lg:text-base"
      >
        Enviar mi historia
      </a>
    </div>

    <!-- Columna derecha: imágenes + stats -->
    <div class="mt-10 lg:mt-0">

      <!-- Fotos -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 lg:gap-3">
        <img
          src="/section1imagen.png"
          alt="Mamá compartiendo su historia"
          class="w-full lg:w-full rounded-2xl object-cover aspect-[3/4] shadow-lg"
        />
        <img
          src="/section1imagen2.png"
          alt="Mamá en el micrófono"
          class="w-full lg:w-full rounded-2xl object-cover aspect-[3/4] shadow-lg"
        />
      </div>

      <!-- Stats -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 lg:gap-3 mt-3 lg:mt-3">
        <!-- 100+ -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-4 lg:p-4 shadow-md">
          <p class="font-bold text-3xl font-sans leading-none mb-1 lg:mb-1 lg:text-4xl">100+</p>
          <svg class="w-6 lg:w-6 h-6 lg:h-6 mb-1 lg:mb-1 text-gray-700" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path d="M16 11c1.66 0 2.99-1.34 2.99-3S17.66 5 16 5c-1.66 0-3 1.34-3 3s1.34 3 3 3zm-8 0c1.66 0 2.99-1.34 2.99-3S9.66 5 8 5C6.34 5 5 6.34 5 8s1.34 3 3 3zm0 2c-2.33 0-7 1.17-7 3.5V19h14v-2.5c0-2.33-4.67-3.5-7-3.5zm8 0c-.29 0-.62.02-.97.05 1.16.84 1.97 1.97 1.97 3.45V19h6v-2.5c0-2.33-4.67-3.5-7-3.5z"/>
          </svg>
          <p class="text-xs lg:text-xs font-display text-gray-600 leading-snug lg:leading-snug">Madres que comparten su historia</p>
        </div>
        <!-- 400K+ -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-4 lg:p-4 shadow-md">
          <p class="font-bold text-3xl font-sans leading-none mb-1 lg:mb-1 lg:text-4xl">400K+</p>
          <svg class="w-6 lg:w-6 h-6 lg:h-6 mb-1 lg:mb-1 text-gray-700" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path d="M12 4.5C7 4.5 2.73 7.61 1 12c1.73 4.39 6 7.5 11 7.5s9.27-3.11 11-7.5c-1.73-4.39-6-7.5-11-7.5zM12 17c-2.76 0-5-2.24-5-5s2.24-5 5-5 5 2.24 5 5-2.24 5-5 5zm0-8c-1.66 0-3 1.34-3 3s1.34 3 3 3 3-1.34 3-3-1.34-3-3-3z"/>
          </svg>
          <p class="text-xs lg:text-xs font-display text-gray-600 leading-snug lg:leading-snug">Visualizaciones en 28 días</p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Scallops verdes colgando hacia la sección morada -->
  <div class="absolute bottom-0 lg:bottom-0 left-0 lg:left-0 w-full lg:w-full translate-y-full lg:translate-y-full">
    <!-- Móvil: 5 scallops -->
    <svg viewBox="0 0 600 60" preserveAspectRatio="none" class="w-full lg:w-full h-8 lg:h-8 lg:hidden">
      <path fill="#A9CF38" d="M0,0 A60,60 0 0,0 120,0 A60,60 0 0,0 240,0 A60,60 0 0,0 360,0 A60,60 0 0,0 480,0 A60,60 0 0,0 600,0 Z"/>
    </svg>
    <!-- Desktop: 12 scallops -->
    <svg viewBox="0 0 1440 60" preserveAspectRatio="none" class="w-full lg:w-full h-12 lg:h-12 hidden lg:block">
      <path fill="#A9CF38" d="M0,0 A60,60 0 0,0 120,0 A60,60 0 0,0 240,0 A60,60 0 0,0 360,0 A60,60 0 0,0 480,0 A60,60 0 0,0 600,0 A60,60 0 0,0 720,0 A60,60 0 0,0 840,0 A60,60 0 0,0 960,0 A60,60 0 0,0 1080,0 A60,60 0 0,0 1200,0 A60,60 0 0,0 1320,0 A60,60 0 0,0 1440,0 Z"/>
    </svg>
  </div>

</section>
